3rd Water Mill Smooth (ISH)[TIH] – 2014 gelding by Watermill Swatch (TB) out of My Smooth Damond (ISH)[TIH] by Diamond Lad (ID).  Breeder: Alan Connaughton. Rider: Kelsey Seidel (USA) 29.5, 0, 0.0 = 29.5

4th Rock Island (ISH)[TIH] – 2017 gelding by Island Commander (TB) out of Coolcorren Gypsey (ISH)[TIH] by Coolcorran Cool Diamond (ISH). Breeder: Michael Byrne. Rider: Robin Walker (USA) 27.6, 0, 2.0 = 29.6

5th Hillside Diamond Lad (ISH)[TIH] – 2017 gelding by Lionwood Kinsales Lad (ID) out of Wedding Day (TB) by With Approval (TB). Breeder: Sarah Cleary. Rider: Liz Lund (USA) 29.8, 0, 0.0 = 29.8.

