Open Modified One Day B
4th Fernhill Quality Vision (ISH)[was Quality Vision] – 2015 gelding by OBOS Quality 004 (OLD) out of Lady Carla (ISH) by Welcome Flagmount (ID). Breeder: Sinead Murphy. Rider: Stephanie Jackson (USA) 33.6, 0, 0.0 = 33.6

5th HTF Cosmic Cooley (ISH)[was Cookstown Sparrow] – 2019 mare by Coupe de Coeur (HOLST) out of Gortglass Sparrow (ISH)[TIH] by Ashfield Bobby Sparrow (CP). Breeder: Donal Callery. Rider: Chris Talley (USA) 33.8, 0, 0.0 = 33.8

7th Fernhill 767 (ISH)[was KEC Paqx] – 2017 gelding by OBOS Quality 004 (OLD) out of Killerick Diamond (ISH) by Glidawn Diamond (ID). Breeder: Oonagh Kennedy. Rider: Amelia Ebhardt (USA) 33.6, 4, 0.0 = 37.6.

Ram Trap Horse Park Horse Trials (USA) 14th – 16th February 2025
