3rd GHS Calexico (ISH) – 2015 mare by Van Gogh (KWPN) out of Penhaligon Cairo (AES) by Cavalier Royale (HOLST). Breeder: Leanne Marshall. Rider: Marc Grandia (USA) 30.2, 0.4, 8.4 = 39.0

