6th Balladeer Kilbrickens Lad (ISH) – 2015 gelding by A. Umonia 60 (KWPN) out of Aubane Girl (ISH) by Silvano (KWPN). Breeder: Sarah Phelan. Rider: Tommy Greengard (USA) 26.0, 0, 20.8 = 46.8.

