These results are funded by Horse Sport Ireland.', 'Martin Crowley’s Crossfield Lass breeds two Top 10 Places at Open Preliminary. OBOS Quality has 7 mentions but only one as a Dam’s Sire and TIH get 17 mentions. Rocking Horse Winter Horse trials (USA) 14th – 16th…', 'https://www.horsesportireland.ie/irish-sport-horses-win-5-classes-including-2-ccis-at-the-gmh-festival/', 'Horse Sport Ireland', '2025-02-17 12:00:00', 2 WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM news WHERE title = 'Irish Sport Horses win 5 classes including 2 CCIs at the GMH Festival');
